index=windows earliest=-15m
```Detection: Account added to the local Administrators group (Event ID 4732).```
```Alert: Any new member added to the built-in Administrators group.```
```False positives: Authorized administrative changes, IT maintenance, or account provisioning.```
```Limitation: Identifies membership changes but cannot establish whether they were authorized.```
| rex field=_raw "<EventID[^>]*>(?<event_id>\d+)</EventID>"
| where event_id="4732"
| rex field=_raw "<Data[^>]*Name=.TargetSid.[^>]*>(?<group_sid>[^<]*)"
| rex field=_raw "<Data[^>]*Name=.MemberSid.[^>]*>(?<member_sid>[^<]*)"
| rex field=_raw "<Data[^>]*Name=.SubjectUserName.[^>]*>(?<actor>[^<]*)"
| where group_sid="S-1-5-32-544"
| table _time host actor member_sid group_sid
| sort -_time
